        "label":  "SLMP Basic Read Write",
        "disabled":  false,
        "info":  "Update the connection host, port, and controlled test addresses before deploy. The optional write path saves D300, D301, and D200, writes random valid values, restores after confirmed acknowledgements, and reads again. D302.3 demonstrates read-only bit-in-word access because slmp-write does not provide implicit read-modify-write."
